WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.210
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:23.480 --> 00:26.050
Dad, Mum.

3
00:26.140 --> 00:31.460
[In Memory of Father Chen Fu and Mother Zhang Wenying]

4
00:27.760 --> 00:29.560
I haven't visited you in 3 years.

5
00:29.670 --> 00:31.270
You won't blame me, will you?

6
00:37.280 --> 00:38.210
Three years ago,

7
00:40.200 --> 00:40.960
I always thought

8
00:40.960 --> 00:42.760
I could see everything clearly.

9
00:45.410 --> 00:47.070
But it turned out I was

10
00:47.750 --> 00:48.610
blind in my eyes

11
00:49.890 --> 00:51.090
and blind in my heart,

12
00:52.530 --> 00:53.790
a complete mess.

13
00:58.210 --> 00:59.380
Three years later,

14
01:01.150 --> 01:03.150
everything has turned upside down.

15
01:04.280 --> 01:05.459
I find myself

16
01:06.710 --> 01:08.710
seeing things more and

17
01:09.590 --> 01:11.039
more clearly.

18
01:21.070 --> 01:21.920
Dad,

19
01:24.280 --> 01:25.680
please bless my plan

20
01:26.490 --> 01:32.180
[In Memory of Father Chen Fu and Mother Zhang Wenying]

21
01:28.230 --> 01:30.630
from the afterlife and help it go smoothly.

22
01:31.760 --> 01:33.870
Even if it costs me my life,

23
01:35.150 --> 01:37.460
I will definitely light up the darkness.

24
01:41.640 --> 01:42.640
When the time comes,

25
01:42.640 --> 01:44.500
let's have a good drink together.

26
04:00.740 --> 04:05.530
[Light the Dark]

27
04:06.390 --> 04:09.140
[Episode 9]

28
04:14.400 --> 04:15.120
Godfather.

29
04:15.610 --> 04:16.399
What brings you here?

30
04:16.399 --> 04:17.390
Come on, let's go inside.

31
04:17.390 --> 04:18.320
No, I won't go in.

32
04:18.339 --> 04:19.399
I'll just stay here

33
04:19.610 --> 04:21.170
and say a few words to you.

34
04:22.130 --> 04:22.970
Well,

35
04:22.970 --> 04:23.730
I'm mainly here this time

36
04:23.730 --> 04:25.530
on behalf of Shan.

37
04:26.240 --> 04:28.450
He knows he was wrong,

38
04:28.730 --> 04:30.610
so he was too embarrassed to come himself.

39
04:30.610 --> 04:32.170
I said I'd come

40
04:32.170 --> 04:32.850
to apologize to you

41
04:32.850 --> 04:33.850
on his behalf.

42
04:33.970 --> 04:35.260
Anyway, we're family.

43
04:35.260 --> 04:36.530
At a time like this,

44
04:36.530 --> 04:38.140
he needs his family

45
04:38.370 --> 04:39.170
to reach out

46
04:39.170 --> 04:40.170
and help him.

47
04:41.020 --> 04:42.610
We've already helped a lot.

48
04:42.610 --> 04:43.850
Yes, you have.

49
04:43.850 --> 04:44.530
But I'm just saying,

50
04:44.530 --> 04:46.340
if we don't help him

51
04:46.610 --> 04:47.820
and figure something out for him,

52
04:47.820 --> 04:49.820
what if he causes even more trouble?

53
04:50.220 --> 04:51.820
We couldn't let that happen.

54
04:53.370 --> 04:54.970
I was thinking, could we...

55
04:55.460 --> 04:56.730
could we maybe...

56
04:56.900 --> 04:58.659
let him join our subsidiary?

57
04:59.360 --> 05:00.930
You can give him some projects.

58
05:00.930 --> 05:01.700
If he has work to do,

59
05:01.700 --> 05:03.500
he won't cause trouble anymore.

60
05:08.490 --> 05:10.150
Godfather, this is a big deal.

61
05:10.970 --> 05:11.700
I need to discuss it

62
05:11.700 --> 05:12.820
with Qi Mo.

63
05:13.100 --> 05:13.850
Yes.

64
05:15.290 --> 05:16.490
How about today?

65
05:16.530 --> 05:17.780
I'll go find a restaurant later,

66
05:17.780 --> 05:18.970
and then while we're eating,

67
05:18.970 --> 05:19.820
we can talk

68
05:19.820 --> 05:21.170
this whole thing out.

69
05:21.170 --> 05:23.570
Once it's cleared up, it'll be fine, right?

70
05:24.050 --> 05:25.780
-Okay? -Well, look at me...

71
05:26.730 --> 05:27.610
Take it home then.

72
05:27.610 --> 05:28.610
As for the reservation,

73
05:28.610 --> 05:29.340
I'll book the restaurant

74
05:29.340 --> 05:30.530
and let you know.

75
05:30.530 --> 05:32.020
Tell Qi Mo...

76
05:32.020 --> 05:33.350
Tell Qi Mo to come along.

77
05:35.220 --> 05:35.970
Okay?

78
05:41.530 --> 05:42.780
The wine is poured.

79
05:44.530 --> 05:46.530
Today is the first time

80
05:46.530 --> 05:47.730
our family

81
05:47.730 --> 05:49.330
has sat down to eat together.

82
05:49.730 --> 05:51.850
If you have anything to say, just speak your mind.

83
05:51.850 --> 05:52.930
Let's talk it out.

84
05:53.260 --> 05:54.050
We are a family.

85
05:54.050 --> 05:55.140
There is no hurdle we can't overcome,

86
05:55.140 --> 05:56.800
and no problem we can't solve.

87
05:57.220 --> 05:58.020
Manager Qi.

88
05:58.820 --> 05:59.780
You are the boss.

89
05:59.780 --> 06:00.460
You speak first.

90
06:00.460 --> 06:01.660
Xiaoyun told me about

91
06:02.460 --> 06:03.700
what you want.

92
06:04.050 --> 06:05.170
You want Shan

93
06:05.580 --> 06:07.730
to join our company.

94
06:08.340 --> 06:10.490
I can totally understand

95
06:10.580 --> 06:12.340
how you and Shan feel.

96
06:12.340 --> 06:13.560
Back then,

97
06:13.780 --> 06:15.540
I also considered it.

98
06:16.930 --> 06:17.900
But now,

99
06:19.460 --> 06:20.850
I can't agree to this.

100
06:22.490 --> 06:23.730
But I... I know...

101
06:23.820 --> 06:25.370
Before, you said that...

102
06:25.370 --> 06:25.730
Well...

103
06:25.730 --> 06:26.390
Godfather.

104
06:26.660 --> 06:28.120
This has nothing to do with

105
06:28.140 --> 06:29.100
when I said it.

106
06:29.460 --> 06:32.490
It's mainly because Shan is unruly.

107
06:33.700 --> 06:34.700
If he goes to the south,

108
06:34.700 --> 06:36.730
where the market is broad and dynamic,

109
06:36.730 --> 06:38.260
he can do whatever he wants.

110
06:38.260 --> 06:38.970
Right?

111
06:39.820 --> 06:40.659
Shan,

112
06:40.780 --> 06:41.460
when you're there,

113
06:41.460 --> 06:44.020
you can try your luck

114
06:44.170 --> 06:45.970
and learn to control your temper.

115
06:45.970 --> 06:47.340
So when you come back, you can get along

116
06:47.340 --> 06:48.740
with your sister better.

117
06:49.170 --> 06:50.659
So right now,

118
06:51.730 --> 06:52.370
it's...

119
06:53.580 --> 06:55.780
not a good time for him to stay in Wugang.

120
06:59.340 --> 07:00.820
Xiaoyun, he is...

121
07:01.340 --> 07:02.970
your own brother... after all.

122
07:02.970 --> 07:04.030
You are his sister.

123
07:04.170 --> 07:06.230
Do you really have the heart to see him

124
07:06.340 --> 07:08.270
-wandering outside? -Godfather.

125
07:08.460 --> 07:09.410
What Qi Mo just said

126
07:09.410 --> 07:10.700
is exactly what I mean.

127
07:15.100 --> 07:16.900
Weren't you tough before?

128
07:18.140 --> 07:19.600
You've changed your mind?

129
07:21.580 --> 07:23.580
Godfather has already talked to me.

130
07:23.700 --> 07:24.850
I have realized

131
07:25.260 --> 07:26.860
that everything I did before

132
07:28.100 --> 07:29.370
was wrong.

133
07:30.370 --> 07:31.570
I was self-righteous

134
07:32.370 --> 07:33.530
and reckless.

135
07:35.170 --> 07:36.500
I apologize to you here.

136
07:38.050 --> 07:39.850
You spent 3 years in prison for nothing.

137
07:39.850 --> 07:40.460
In prison,

138
07:40.460 --> 07:42.320
how exactly did they educate you?

139
07:42.730 --> 07:44.140
Or as soon as you came out,

140
07:44.170 --> 07:45.900
you forgot about those 3 years?

141
07:46.340 --> 07:47.170
Xiaoyun.

142
07:49.490 --> 07:51.700
Rise quietly, keep the noise down!

143
07:51.700 --> 07:53.850
Wash up and use the toilet in turn!

144
07:53.850 --> 07:56.100
Wear your uniform and ID badge!

145
07:56.100 --> 07:58.260
Keep your quarters neat and tidy!

146
07:58.260 --> 08:00.410
Stay clean and keep things organized!

147
08:00.410 --> 08:02.530
Keep your surroundings clean!

148
08:02.530 --> 08:04.780
Get haircuts, wash your clothes!

149
08:04.780 --> 08:06.970
Trim your nails, bathe regularly!

150
08:12.820 --> 08:14.490
These are just routines.

151
08:14.970 --> 08:16.140
When I first went in,

152
08:16.970 --> 08:19.500
I didn't know the rules and offended someone.

153
08:20.020 --> 08:21.480
When you're being beaten,

154
08:22.170 --> 08:24.020
you have to protect your head like this.

155
08:24.020 --> 08:25.880
Like this. Crouch down like this.

156
08:25.970 --> 08:27.630
Take the blows with your back.

157
08:27.700 --> 08:29.020
That way, you won't get hurt as easily.

158
08:29.020 --> 08:29.820
Also,

159
08:29.970 --> 08:32.130
doing chores is the most important thing.

160
08:32.130 --> 08:33.299
Some people

161
08:33.299 --> 08:34.820
fold paper boxes.

162
08:34.820 --> 08:37.370
Some make clothes.

163
08:37.820 --> 08:39.460
My class's chore

164
08:40.059 --> 08:40.770
was making candles.

165
08:40.770 --> 08:41.970
It was quite interesting.

166
08:41.970 --> 08:43.299
It was easy,

167
08:43.419 --> 08:44.820
but you had to be careful.

168
08:45.460 --> 08:47.190
Someone might swallow a candle

169
08:47.370 --> 08:49.300
and choke on it.

170
08:52.940 --> 08:54.220
I swallowed one before.

171
08:54.220 --> 08:54.940
Sh-Shan.

172
08:54.940 --> 08:55.850
Let's not talk about that.

173
08:55.850 --> 08:57.290
Let's not talk about that.

174
08:57.290 --> 08:58.300
-Ying. Mo. -Let's not...

175
08:58.300 --> 08:59.900
What else do you want to hear?

176
08:59.940 --> 09:00.730
Tell me.

177
09:00.900 --> 09:02.180
I can tell you everything.

178
09:02.180 --> 09:02.940
No, no.

179
09:02.960 --> 09:03.970
-No. -Really, Mo.

180
09:04.130 --> 09:05.060
As long as you

181
09:05.340 --> 09:06.700
let me stay,

182
09:06.730 --> 09:08.890
I, Chen Shan, will do anything you want.

183
09:08.890 --> 09:09.700
Really.

184
09:09.730 --> 09:11.370
You need to face reality.

185
09:12.180 --> 09:13.640
You are different from us.

186
09:16.100 --> 09:17.700
You have blood on your hands.

187
09:18.540 --> 09:20.540
Ma Yiming was even younger than you,

188
09:20.540 --> 09:22.340
but you killed him.

189
09:22.940 --> 09:24.060
As soon as you came out of prison after 3 years,

190
09:24.060 --> 09:26.030
you came to our house to make a scene

191
09:27.060 --> 09:28.220
and slander us.

192
09:28.220 --> 09:30.100
What kind of rumors were you spreading?

193
09:30.100 --> 09:30.650
Xiaoyun...

194
09:30.650 --> 09:32.250
Godfather, stay out of this.

195
09:34.420 --> 09:34.820
I know

196
09:34.820 --> 09:37.080
you care about your husband's feelings.

197
09:38.220 --> 09:39.010
Mo.

198
09:39.890 --> 09:41.340
The nonsense I just said

199
09:41.370 --> 09:42.770
won't solve the problem.

200
09:42.770 --> 09:43.580
I'll finish

201
09:43.820 --> 09:44.770
this bottle of wine

202
09:44.770 --> 09:45.850
to apologize to you.

203
09:45.850 --> 09:46.890
No. No.

204
09:47.130 --> 09:48.290
Shan! Shan!

205
09:48.480 --> 09:49.340
Shan!

206
09:49.370 --> 09:50.360
It's not about it!

207
09:50.360 --> 09:51.560
-Shan. -You can't...

208
09:52.100 --> 09:53.560
You can't drink like this.

209
10:28.370 --> 10:29.610
Drink these 3 bowls,

210
10:30.250 --> 10:31.490
and I'll let you join the company.

211
10:31.490 --> 10:32.300
Well...

212
10:32.760 --> 10:33.970
You don't need to do this.

213
10:33.970 --> 10:36.220
Aren't you showing your determination?

214
10:36.220 --> 10:37.820
Drink it if you have the guts.

215
10:38.100 --> 10:40.100
If you dare to throw up even a little,

216
10:40.250 --> 10:42.210
don't ever mention this to me again.

217
10:42.210 --> 10:43.840
Um, Xiaoyun.

218
10:44.340 --> 10:45.130
About this,

219
10:45.220 --> 10:46.750
should we discuss it again?

220
11:19.400 --> 11:20.340
Alright. Alright.

221
11:20.340 --> 11:22.180
Come on, drink some water. Here.

222
11:23.340 --> 11:24.490
Alright, Xiaoyun.

223
11:24.490 --> 11:25.130
That's enough.

224
11:25.130 --> 11:26.250
Alright. Look at him.

225
11:26.250 --> 11:27.700
He knows he was wrong.

226
11:27.770 --> 11:29.250
He drank all three bowls.

227
11:29.250 --> 11:30.370
He knows he was wrong.

228
11:30.370 --> 11:31.540
Here. Here.

229
11:33.180 --> 11:33.970
Qi Mo,

230
11:34.490 --> 11:35.460
here is your favorite

231
11:35.460 --> 11:36.420
spicy beef.

232
11:40.100 --> 11:41.300
Sit down and eat up.

233
11:47.180 --> 11:47.970
Um...

234
11:50.460 --> 11:51.300
Well...

235
11:52.460 --> 11:53.130
Godfather,

236
11:53.940 --> 11:54.870
what do you think

237
11:55.370 --> 11:56.700
we should do about Shan?

238
11:58.770 --> 12:01.210
It's better for him to be closer to home.

239
12:02.060 --> 12:03.220
But I know you and Xiaoyun

240
12:03.220 --> 12:04.280
are busy with work.

241
12:04.650 --> 12:05.770
Let him come to my company.

242
12:05.770 --> 12:06.490
If he comes to my company,

243
12:06.490 --> 12:07.370
I can...

244
12:07.460 --> 12:08.920
help you keep an eye on him.

245
12:12.600 --> 12:13.210
Okay.

246
12:14.300 --> 12:15.370
Then it's settled.

247
12:16.580 --> 12:17.650
I'll find some business for him

248
12:17.650 --> 12:18.850
to practice on first.

249
12:18.850 --> 12:19.540
Right.

250
12:19.540 --> 12:20.300
Right.

251
12:20.300 --> 12:21.730
Hurry up and thank your brother-in-law.

252
12:21.730 --> 12:23.700
-He's so thoughtful. -Excuse me. Sorry to bother you.

253
12:23.700 --> 12:25.220
Today is our restaurant's anniversary.

254
12:25.220 --> 12:26.250
All customers who make a purchase

255
12:26.250 --> 12:27.180
can get free photos

256
12:27.180 --> 12:28.340
taken and printed.

257
12:28.340 --> 12:29.220
Your family looks

258
12:29.220 --> 12:30.340
so happy together.

259
12:30.540 --> 12:32.180
Would you like to take a group photo?

260
12:32.180 --> 12:32.940
We can't...

261
12:32.940 --> 12:33.610
Sure.

262
12:34.730 --> 12:35.730
Please make us

263
12:35.730 --> 12:36.970
look nice.

264
12:36.970 --> 12:37.730
No problem.

265
12:37.770 --> 12:39.300
Please stand over there.

266
12:39.770 --> 12:40.580
Godfather,

267
12:40.770 --> 12:41.540
you are the elder.

268
12:41.540 --> 12:42.490
Please sit here.

269
12:42.580 --> 12:43.370
I... I can't.

270
12:43.370 --> 12:44.460
I shouldn't...

271
12:44.460 --> 12:44.970
sit there.

272
12:44.970 --> 12:45.340
Come on.

273
12:45.340 --> 12:45.820
Godfather,

274
12:45.820 --> 12:46.970
listen... listen to Xiaoyun.

275
12:46.970 --> 12:48.300
Come, please.

276
12:48.300 --> 12:48.730
Okay, I'll sit there.

277
12:48.730 --> 12:49.860
Come on, Godfather.

278
12:50.180 --> 12:50.610
Come.

279
12:50.610 --> 12:51.010
Sit.

280
12:51.010 --> 12:51.370
Sit.

281
12:51.370 --> 12:53.630
Everyone, lean towards the middle a bit.

282
12:53.940 --> 12:55.850
Okay, smile.

283
12:55.850 --> 12:56.650
Three.

284
12:56.700 --> 12:57.460
Two.

285
12:57.460 --> 12:58.180
One.

286
12:58.180 --> 12:59.710
Cheese.

287
13:21.490 --> 13:22.610
Did I...

288
13:23.130 --> 13:24.660
do the right thing just now?

289
13:25.370 --> 13:26.180
Yes,

290
13:26.890 --> 13:27.700
you did.

291
13:28.420 --> 13:29.220
After all, the Chen family

292
13:29.220 --> 13:30.650
raised me.

293
13:31.370 --> 13:32.290
Besides,

294
13:33.010 --> 13:34.420
Godfather had said that.

295
13:35.130 --> 13:36.860
We had to show him some respect.

296
13:37.250 --> 13:38.010
Otherwise, people

297
13:38.010 --> 13:39.750
would talk behind my back.

298
13:40.070 --> 13:41.390
Then

299
13:41.610 --> 13:43.100
you would be implicated.

300
13:44.940 --> 13:46.340
Also, we need to find a way

301
13:46.940 --> 13:48.540
to keep Chen Shan in check.

302
13:49.300 --> 13:51.030
Otherwise, with his big mouth,

303
13:51.180 --> 13:52.420
he'd spread rumors everywhere

304
13:52.420 --> 13:54.280
about what happened to Ma Yiming.

305
13:54.820 --> 13:55.700
I can't let you take the blame

306
13:55.700 --> 13:57.300
for something you didn't do.

307
14:01.250 --> 14:02.060
Xiaoyun.

308
14:02.990 --> 14:04.060
I'm so lucky

309
14:04.560 --> 14:05.590
to have married you.

310
14:05.590 --> 14:06.970
You always think things through

311
14:06.970 --> 14:08.010
so carefully.

312
14:08.770 --> 14:09.340
Alright.

313
14:09.360 --> 14:11.060
Then let's go with the decision

314
14:11.060 --> 14:12.190
we made at the table.

315
14:12.490 --> 14:14.820
I'll allocate some projects to him later.

316
14:14.900 --> 14:15.880
But don't worry.

317
14:15.900 --> 14:16.850
I'll arrange

318
14:17.540 --> 14:18.910
some projects for him far away,

319
14:18.910 --> 14:21.510
so he won't be wandering around in front of you.

320
14:39.620 --> 14:40.370
Be careful.

321
14:40.390 --> 14:41.060
Over here.

322
14:41.080 --> 14:42.010
Just put it here.

323
14:42.200 --> 14:42.990
Alright.

324
14:43.010 --> 14:43.490
Good.

325
14:44.300 --> 14:45.490
There are two cabinets outside.

326
14:45.490 --> 14:46.220
Help me carry them.

327
14:46.220 --> 14:47.240
Okay.

328
14:47.940 --> 14:48.540
That...

329
14:49.210 --> 14:50.230
Okay.

330
14:50.470 --> 14:51.470
Just put it there.

331
14:55.610 --> 14:56.540
Don't wipe it yet.

332
14:56.540 --> 14:58.180
Sweep over there.

333
14:58.180 --> 14:58.650
Sweep it.

334
14:58.650 --> 14:59.300
Shan.

335
14:59.850 --> 15:00.370
Godfather.

336
15:00.370 --> 15:01.570
Come here. Come here.

337
15:02.420 --> 15:03.940
Help me put it on that desk.

338
15:06.300 --> 15:07.420
What's wrong, Godfather?

339
15:07.420 --> 15:08.250
Look.

340
15:08.580 --> 15:09.490
They gave us

341
15:09.490 --> 15:10.960
the first phase of the Project 713

342
15:10.960 --> 15:12.020
maintenance work.

343
15:13.410 --> 15:14.540
When I went there...

344
15:14.540 --> 15:15.580
You know what?

345
15:15.580 --> 15:17.180
They allocated 1 million to us this time.

346
15:17.180 --> 15:17.820
Besides that,

347
15:17.820 --> 15:19.340
they sent 80 people.

348
15:20.540 --> 15:21.610
You're amazing, Godfather.

349
15:21.610 --> 15:22.820
I'm not amazing.

350
15:22.820 --> 15:23.760
You are the amazing one.

351
15:23.760 --> 15:25.220
That day...

352
15:25.220 --> 15:26.180
That day at the hot pot restaurant,

353
15:26.180 --> 15:27.100
my heart almost broke

354
15:27.100 --> 15:29.300
seeing you like that.

355
15:29.300 --> 15:30.420
Those three bowls

356
15:30.420 --> 15:30.970
of chili.

357
15:30.970 --> 15:31.890
The hot pot base...

358
15:31.890 --> 15:33.490
And with baijiu...

359
15:33.490 --> 15:33.850
Three bowls.

360
15:33.850 --> 15:35.610
It hurt me just to watch you drink it.

361
15:35.610 --> 15:36.370
You know?

362
15:37.490 --> 15:39.570
Shan, you really have the determination.

363
15:39.570 --> 15:40.820
With this determination,

364
15:40.820 --> 15:41.580
you can definitely achieve

365
15:41.580 --> 15:42.820
something great.

366
15:42.820 --> 15:44.550
What great thing can I achieve?

367
15:45.010 --> 15:46.770
I'll just follow you from now on.

368
15:46.770 --> 15:48.130
I'll do whatever you say.

369
15:48.130 --> 15:49.240
Alright, my godson.

370
15:49.240 --> 15:50.440
Let's do it together.

371
15:50.650 --> 15:51.420
I was thinking,

372
15:51.420 --> 15:52.970
about this maintenance...

373
15:52.970 --> 15:53.970
While we're working on

374
15:53.970 --> 15:55.340
this maintenance project,

375
15:55.340 --> 15:56.540
we must take the opportunity to investigate

376
15:56.540 --> 15:58.460
how your father died.

377
15:58.730 --> 15:59.490
I've made up my mind.

378
15:59.490 --> 16:00.540
I must make

379
16:00.540 --> 16:02.280
this shameless hypocrite

380
16:02.310 --> 16:03.510
show his true colors!

381
16:04.060 --> 16:05.220
Very good. Very good.

382
16:05.220 --> 16:06.300
You're tidying up?

383
16:06.300 --> 16:07.700
It's arranged very well.

384
16:08.250 --> 16:09.570
Okay, wipe it all.

385
16:09.650 --> 16:10.420
Wipe the dust inside

386
16:10.420 --> 16:11.680
thoroughly.

387
16:11.960 --> 16:12.890
Hammer.

388
16:16.130 --> 16:16.940
Wrench.

389
16:19.250 --> 16:20.060
Here, Master.

390
16:24.650 --> 16:26.000
No. 7.

391
16:29.300 --> 16:30.100
Here.

392
16:34.310 --> 16:35.540
Hurry up. No. 5.

393
16:38.890 --> 16:40.610
Hurry up. No. 5 wrench.

394
16:44.820 --> 16:46.300
No. 5 wrench. Hurry up!

395
16:47.160 --> 16:50.090
Can't you tell the difference between No. 5 and No. 7?

396
17:04.819 --> 17:05.579
Jie.

397
17:07.130 --> 17:08.260
Bro.

398
17:18.650 --> 17:19.540
This is the basin hot pot

399
17:19.540 --> 17:20.890
I kept telling you about

400
17:20.890 --> 17:21.890
in prison.

401
17:21.890 --> 17:22.950
Here, give it a try.

402
17:23.300 --> 17:24.099
This is my specialty.

403
17:24.099 --> 17:25.170
I'm not bragging,

404
17:25.300 --> 17:26.690
but every hot pot restaurant in Wugang

405
17:26.690 --> 17:27.410
would be out of business

406
17:27.410 --> 17:29.010
if they went up against this.

407
17:29.020 --> 17:29.820
Go on, try it.

408
17:30.980 --> 17:32.570
How is it? Is it good?

409
17:32.740 --> 17:33.580
Is it good?

410
17:36.890 --> 17:38.300
Now I finally understand.

411
17:38.300 --> 17:40.630
Freedom matters more than anything else.

412
17:41.890 --> 17:42.500
Jie.

413
17:43.300 --> 17:44.540
Sometimes,

414
17:45.980 --> 17:48.440
I really feel you've been treated unfairly.

415
17:48.820 --> 17:49.850
You did so much

416
17:49.850 --> 17:50.980
for Wan Yang.

417
17:51.650 --> 17:53.300
What did you get in the end?

418
17:53.610 --> 17:54.930
Look at Liu Hong.

419
17:55.690 --> 17:57.500
She only did 3 months inside and then got out.

420
17:57.500 --> 17:58.300
Why?

421
17:59.020 --> 18:00.370
Because before Wan Yang died,

422
18:00.370 --> 18:01.850
he wrote a suicide note

423
18:01.850 --> 18:02.980
taking all the blame

424
18:02.980 --> 18:03.820
himself,

425
18:03.820 --> 18:04.980
just to protect her.

426
18:11.100 --> 18:12.230
Let me tell you, bro.

427
18:12.930 --> 18:14.540
Don't be fooled by Liu Hong

428
18:14.580 --> 18:15.540
doing odd jobs

429
18:15.820 --> 18:17.280
and being down on her luck.

430
18:17.850 --> 18:19.850
She's actually making a fortune.

431
18:21.340 --> 18:23.260
At least 15,000 yuan goes into

432
18:23.260 --> 18:25.020
her account every month.

433
18:26.500 --> 18:27.410
Her daughter

434
18:27.890 --> 18:29.450
is living it up in the US.

435
18:29.750 --> 18:31.650
And Liu Jun, that good-for-nothing.

436
18:31.650 --> 18:32.690
He's been blowing thousands

437
18:32.690 --> 18:33.510
at the mahjong parlor every day.

438
18:33.510 --> 18:35.170
She's supporting all of them.

439
18:35.210 --> 18:36.300
Really?

440
18:36.370 --> 18:37.210
Really.

441
18:37.980 --> 18:39.890
I haven't been sitting around since I got out.

442
18:39.890 --> 18:41.650
I dug all this up myself.

443
18:41.890 --> 18:43.550
These are the actual figures.

444
18:46.410 --> 18:48.070
What exactly do you want to do?

445
18:48.300 --> 18:49.060
Just tell me.

446
18:57.020 --> 18:57.930
Jie?

447
19:02.500 --> 19:04.820
You haven't changed a bit in the past 3 years.

448
19:04.820 --> 19:06.020
Still playing cards,

449
19:06.540 --> 19:07.820
still drinking.

450
19:08.170 --> 19:09.170
Unlike me.

451
19:09.300 --> 19:10.980
Look what I've become.

452
19:11.840 --> 19:12.920
Jie.

453
19:13.020 --> 19:13.820
Come on.

454
19:13.820 --> 19:14.690
Don't say that.

455
19:14.690 --> 19:16.330
We're just having a bit of fun.

456
19:16.330 --> 19:17.450
Let me introduce you

457
19:17.450 --> 19:18.130
to my buddy...

458
19:18.130 --> 19:18.820
No need.

459
19:19.100 --> 19:20.370
I know him.

460
19:20.540 --> 19:21.610
Chen Shan. Shan.

461
19:21.610 --> 19:22.480
-No. -Shan...

462
19:23.340 --> 19:24.340
He's my buddy

463
19:24.340 --> 19:25.850
from the 3 years I spent in prison.

464
19:25.850 --> 19:27.340
His parents' deaths

465
19:27.340 --> 19:28.370
had something to do with your brother-in-law.

466
19:28.370 --> 19:30.230
You haven't forgotten, have you?

467
19:30.570 --> 19:32.340
Yeah, they died...

468
19:33.020 --> 19:34.750
because of my brother-in-law.

469
19:34.930 --> 19:36.170
Come on, Shan.

470
19:36.170 --> 19:37.830
This had nothing to do with me.

471
19:37.980 --> 19:38.780
I had absolutely

472
19:38.780 --> 19:39.780
nothing to do with it.

473
19:39.780 --> 19:40.260
Shan,

474
19:40.260 --> 19:41.410
please, have a seat.

475
19:45.220 --> 19:46.420
Okay, okay. I'll sit.

476
19:47.870 --> 19:49.000
Let's talk this out

477
19:49.340 --> 19:50.130
calmly.

478
19:50.400 --> 19:51.650
What did I ever do to you?

479
19:51.650 --> 19:52.450
Shall we talk?

480
19:52.650 --> 19:53.780
Okay, let's talk. Let's talk.

481
19:53.780 --> 19:54.260
Three years ago,

482
19:54.260 --> 19:55.820
when your brother-in-law was the director,

483
19:55.820 --> 19:57.020
we played cards every day.

484
19:57.020 --> 19:58.300
You lost every time,

485
19:58.300 --> 19:59.450
and I won every time.

486
19:59.450 --> 20:01.020
But you always ran off without paying.

487
20:01.020 --> 20:01.820
So,

488
20:01.820 --> 20:03.020
how much do you owe me?

489
20:04.650 --> 20:06.610
W-Well, it's been a long time.

490
20:07.100 --> 20:08.130
I had money back then.

491
20:08.130 --> 20:09.610
About 70,000 or 80,000.

492
20:09.610 --> 20:10.370
I had money back then,

493
20:10.370 --> 20:11.300
but you didn't ask me for it.

494
20:11.300 --> 20:12.170
Aren't I here today

495
20:12.170 --> 20:13.300
to ask for the money?

496
20:13.650 --> 20:14.450
How much?

497
20:14.740 --> 20:16.670
I... I really don't have any money.

498
20:17.130 --> 20:19.390
Thirty thousand. That's not much, is it?

499
20:20.300 --> 20:21.410
And there's something else.

500
20:21.410 --> 20:22.300
Do you know

501
20:22.370 --> 20:24.320
how much I suffered in prison

502
20:24.370 --> 20:25.580
over the past 3 years?

503
20:25.580 --> 20:26.100
That doesn't really

504
20:26.100 --> 20:27.850
have much to do with me.

505
20:29.100 --> 20:30.100
Thirty thousand.

506
20:32.450 --> 20:34.850
And there's that shipment from 3 years ago.

507
20:35.020 --> 20:36.020
If you hadn't messed it up

508
20:36.020 --> 20:36.890
and I'd managed to sell it,

509
20:36.890 --> 20:37.980
I'd have gotten 70% of the profit

510
20:37.980 --> 20:39.580
as your brother-in-law promised.

511
20:39.580 --> 20:41.020
How much would that have been?

512
20:41.020 --> 20:41.850
Do the math.

513
20:43.980 --> 20:45.500
Th-That would've been a lot.

514
20:45.500 --> 20:46.300
Listen.

515
20:46.500 --> 20:47.850
And my buddy here.

516
20:47.850 --> 20:49.370
I'm standing up for him today.

517
20:49.370 --> 20:50.450
His parents' deaths,

518
20:50.450 --> 20:51.500
plus all the suffering

519
20:51.500 --> 20:52.690
he went through in prison.

520
20:52.690 --> 20:53.890
One hundred thousand

521
20:54.010 --> 20:55.020
in total.

522
20:56.020 --> 20:56.930
That's not too much to ask, is it?

523
20:56.930 --> 20:58.550
Well...

524
20:59.020 --> 20:59.800
Jie.

525
21:00.020 --> 21:01.540
Aren't you extorting me?

526
21:01.540 --> 21:02.890
So what if I am?

527
21:02.910 --> 21:04.310
Jie! Jie! Jie!

528
21:04.340 --> 21:06.060
Jie! Jie! Put it down! Calm down!

529
21:06.060 --> 21:06.820
Put it down first!

530
21:06.820 --> 21:08.020
Let's talk this out!

531
21:08.040 --> 21:08.960
One hundred thousand it is!

532
21:08.960 --> 21:10.090
Let's talk this out.

533
21:10.450 --> 21:11.340
Let's talk this out.

534
21:11.340 --> 21:12.510
Okay?

535
21:13.330 --> 21:14.830
Which part

536
21:15.450 --> 21:16.790
of what I just said is unreasonable?

537
21:16.790 --> 21:17.790
It's reasonable.

538
21:18.210 --> 21:19.410
It's all reasonable.

539
21:20.540 --> 21:22.020
Look, I really don't have money.

540
21:22.020 --> 21:23.210
When I play mahjong now,

541
21:23.210 --> 21:24.980
I use playing cards instead of real money.

542
21:24.980 --> 21:26.190
Just to satisfy the craving.

543
21:26.190 --> 21:27.130
I'm not playing for money at all.

544
21:27.130 --> 21:29.300
Look, I don't have any.

545
21:29.410 --> 21:30.850
I really don't have money.

546
21:30.850 --> 21:31.650
Jie.

547
21:32.170 --> 21:32.980
Jie.

548
21:34.260 --> 21:34.780
Come on.

549
21:37.370 --> 21:38.500
You have 10 fingers.

550
21:38.890 --> 21:40.820
Each of them deserves 10,000.

551
21:40.820 --> 21:41.610
Will you pay?

552
21:41.610 --> 21:42.260
I'll pay!

553
21:42.260 --> 21:43.540
Okay, okay! My sister has money!

554
21:43.540 --> 21:44.690
Listen to me! My sister has it!

555
21:44.690 --> 21:45.980
My sister will give me money!

556
21:45.980 --> 21:48.040
Where does your sister get her money?

557
21:48.300 --> 21:50.130
Well, my sister...

558
21:50.640 --> 21:51.870
Someone gives her money.

559
21:51.870 --> 21:53.540
He gives her money every month.

560
21:53.540 --> 21:54.170
Who?

561
21:54.690 --> 21:56.290
Who gives your sister money?

562
21:57.450 --> 21:58.260
Geng Jian.

563
21:58.460 --> 21:59.420
It's Geng Jian.

564
21:59.740 --> 22:01.100
My sister has something on Geng Jian.

565
22:01.100 --> 22:02.930
He gives my sister 15,000 every month.

566
22:02.930 --> 22:03.740
Really.

567
22:06.060 --> 22:07.460
What does she have on him?

568
22:09.300 --> 22:10.300
It seems to have something to do

569
22:10.300 --> 22:11.610
with your Chen family.

570
22:18.450 --> 22:19.260
Shan.

571
22:19.260 --> 22:19.930
Shan.

572
22:20.370 --> 22:21.170
Well...

573
22:22.950 --> 22:24.070
Tell me.

574
22:25.130 --> 22:26.460
What does she have on him

575
22:26.820 --> 22:28.300
that's about our family?

576
22:28.580 --> 22:29.820
As for what exactly it is,

577
22:29.820 --> 22:31.170
I really don't know.

578
22:31.170 --> 22:32.210
You don't know, huh?

579
22:32.210 --> 22:33.500
I swear. I really don't know!

580
22:33.500 --> 22:33.980
You...

581
22:33.980 --> 22:34.850
If I really knew...

582
22:34.850 --> 22:35.580
If I knew,

583
22:35.580 --> 22:36.300
may I be struck by lightning

584
22:36.300 --> 22:36.930
and die a horrible death!

585
22:36.930 --> 22:37.740
Believe me!

586
22:37.740 --> 22:38.980
Shan, I really don't know.

587
22:38.980 --> 22:40.020
Please believe me.

588
22:40.020 --> 22:40.780
Believe me.

589
22:41.060 --> 22:42.190
I really don't know.

590
22:46.590 --> 22:48.120
One hundred thousand yuan.

591
22:48.980 --> 22:50.220
Give it to me in 3 days.

592
22:51.340 --> 22:51.850
How much did I say?

593
22:51.850 --> 22:52.560
One hundred thousand.

594
22:52.560 --> 22:53.450
How many days?

595
22:53.740 --> 22:54.540
Three days.

596
22:54.630 --> 22:55.390
Three days.

597
22:55.450 --> 22:56.780
Three days. Three days.

598
22:56.780 --> 22:57.930
Not a penny less.

599
22:57.950 --> 22:58.890
Not a penny less.

600
22:58.890 --> 22:59.540
Go.

601
23:00.850 --> 23:02.050
I'm going. I'm going.

602
23:13.130 --> 23:13.740
Sister.

603
23:13.820 --> 23:15.350
They are serious this time.

604
23:15.370 --> 23:16.690
They are going after Yang!

605
23:16.690 --> 23:17.210
Sister.

606
23:17.210 --> 23:18.550
That's your nephew!

607
23:18.580 --> 23:19.580
He's only five.

608
23:19.740 --> 23:21.060
He's the only son

609
23:21.060 --> 23:22.820
in our Liu family, Sister!

610
23:23.130 --> 23:23.850
Sister?

611
23:24.610 --> 23:25.340
Sister.

612
23:26.150 --> 23:27.680
I know you don't have money.

613
23:28.500 --> 23:30.290
I know it's not easy for you now.

614
23:30.720 --> 23:31.850
Ask Geng Jian for it.

615
23:32.650 --> 23:34.170
If he can give you 15,000,

616
23:34.300 --> 23:35.170
he can give you 100,000.

617
23:35.170 --> 23:36.160
Right, Sister?

618
23:36.650 --> 23:37.740
Please say something.

619
23:37.740 --> 23:39.340
I really have no other way this time!

620
23:39.340 --> 23:40.820
I'm begging you, Sister!

621
23:40.930 --> 23:42.480
I'm begging you. Please.

622
23:43.500 --> 23:44.500
We can't just watch Yang

623
23:44.500 --> 23:46.100
be ruined like this, Sister.

624
23:49.850 --> 23:50.650
Sister.

625
23:51.100 --> 23:52.210
If you don't help me this time,

626
23:52.210 --> 23:54.340
I'll die right in front of you, Sister!

627
23:55.980 --> 23:57.410
Die then, Liu Jun!

628
23:57.410 --> 23:58.710
Die!

629
23:58.890 --> 24:00.220
You won't die, will you?

630
24:00.370 --> 24:01.300
I'll die right in front of you!

631
24:01.300 --> 24:01.930
Sister!

632
24:02.100 --> 24:04.100
Sister, I'm sorry! Don't do this!

633
24:04.210 --> 24:05.170
Please don't!

634
24:05.410 --> 24:06.260
I was wrong.

635
24:06.260 --> 24:07.210
What are you doing?

636
24:07.210 --> 24:09.730
What are you doing, Liu Jun?

637
24:10.020 --> 24:10.820
Sister...

638
24:11.300 --> 24:12.170
I was wrong!

639
24:12.170 --> 24:13.020
I was really wrong!

640
24:13.020 --> 24:14.170
I was really wrong!

641
24:14.170 --> 24:15.450
I can only help you this once.

642
24:15.450 --> 24:16.210
Really.

643
24:17.260 --> 24:18.890
I can only help you this once.

644
24:18.890 --> 24:19.950
Do you understand?

645
24:20.020 --> 24:21.450
If there's a next time,

646
24:23.000 --> 24:24.550
I'll die right here!

647
24:24.570 --> 24:25.660
Do you believe me?

648
24:26.170 --> 24:27.000
Did you hear me?

649
24:27.000 --> 24:27.910
Yes, Sister.

650
24:33.310 --> 24:36.350
[Dongzi Hotpot Restaurant]

651
25:12.300 --> 25:13.360
Where is the money?

652
25:13.580 --> 25:15.440
I still can't get the money today.

653
25:16.020 --> 25:16.930
No money, huh?

654
25:23.540 --> 25:25.270
It's okay if you don't admit it.

655
25:25.650 --> 25:27.300
Let's go to the police station.

656
25:27.300 --> 25:28.450
They are professionals.

657
25:28.450 --> 25:30.130
Let them analyze it.

658
25:30.450 --> 25:31.890
I made a lot of mistakes.

659
25:32.130 --> 25:35.060
I might get 7 or 8 years in jail.

660
25:35.230 --> 25:36.550
But murder

661
25:36.990 --> 25:38.400
means the death penalty.

662
25:41.690 --> 25:43.130
Look at the contract.

663
25:44.740 --> 25:45.410
They added...

664
25:45.410 --> 25:46.820
another million to it.

665
25:46.930 --> 25:48.210
It... it will arrive tomorrow.

666
25:48.210 --> 25:49.130
If you can wait,

667
25:49.300 --> 25:51.560
I'll... I'll give you 100,000 tomorrow.

668
25:52.410 --> 25:54.100
Alright, tomorrow then.

669
25:55.360 --> 25:56.440
But Liu Hong,

670
25:56.580 --> 25:57.660
let me tell you,

671
25:57.850 --> 25:59.050
this is the last time.

672
25:59.410 --> 26:00.210
And...

673
26:00.260 --> 26:01.130
when I give you the money tomorrow,

674
26:01.130 --> 26:02.370
give me that tape.

675
26:03.410 --> 26:04.130
Okay.

676
26:04.820 --> 26:05.210
Just give me

677
26:05.210 --> 26:06.690
the money tomorrow.

678
26:09.850 --> 26:10.930
It's a deal.

679
26:12.300 --> 26:13.500
Tomorrow. 100,000.

680
26:13.980 --> 26:14.930
It's a deal.

681
26:37.500 --> 26:38.930
I've read the project proposal

682
26:38.930 --> 26:40.060
for the subsidiary.

683
26:40.210 --> 26:41.940
About that one million, now...

684
26:42.100 --> 26:43.560
Don't transfer the money.

685
26:45.450 --> 26:46.260
What's wrong?

686
26:47.300 --> 26:48.740
Godfather is embezzling.

687
26:48.740 --> 26:49.540
Embezzling?

688
26:50.980 --> 26:52.360
You can't just say things like that.

689
26:52.360 --> 26:53.330
I've checked.

690
26:53.500 --> 26:55.690
Although the accounts were carefully falsified,

691
26:55.690 --> 26:56.690
I'm sure about it.

692
26:57.060 --> 26:59.590
It's hundreds of thousands over three years.

693
27:05.820 --> 27:06.610
Here.

694
27:07.980 --> 27:08.780
Here.

695
27:09.300 --> 27:10.630
It's in all three books.

696
27:18.070 --> 27:21.020
Don't transfer that one million to the subsidiary yet.

697
27:21.020 --> 27:22.420
Yes, hold on to it for now.

698
27:41.130 --> 27:42.060
Secretary Chen.

699
27:43.130 --> 27:43.930
Manager Qi.

700
27:46.450 --> 27:47.250
I'm here.

701
27:53.580 --> 27:54.370
Mr. Geng.

702
27:55.740 --> 27:56.370
Manager Qi

703
27:56.370 --> 27:58.170
wants to ask you a few questions.

704
27:58.610 --> 27:59.370
Go ahead.

705
28:01.380 --> 28:02.370
I've seen how close you are

706
28:02.370 --> 28:03.650
to Manager Qi.

707
28:04.260 --> 28:05.060
How has Manager Qi

708
28:05.060 --> 28:06.210
been treating you?

709
28:06.890 --> 28:08.100
W-Well, that's obvious, isn't it?

710
28:08.100 --> 28:09.370
Putting aside the fact

711
28:09.370 --> 28:10.500
that we're relatives,

712
28:10.500 --> 28:12.580
he's always looked after me

713
28:12.580 --> 28:14.110
and treated me really well.

714
28:14.860 --> 28:16.270
He's given you

715
28:16.540 --> 28:17.710
tremendous support,

716
28:17.710 --> 28:18.610
both at work and in your personal life,

717
28:18.610 --> 28:19.690
hasn't he?

718
28:20.690 --> 28:21.500
Yes.

719
28:22.260 --> 28:24.060
He's closer to me than my own family.

720
28:24.060 --> 28:25.390
Then let me ask you this.

721
28:25.440 --> 28:27.500
Is there anything you've been hiding

722
28:27.600 --> 28:28.550
from Manager Qi?

723
28:29.450 --> 28:30.250
Or

724
28:30.650 --> 28:31.820
have you ever done anything

725
28:31.820 --> 28:33.100
to betray him?

726
28:35.270 --> 28:37.340
No, no. How...

727
28:37.370 --> 28:38.260
How could I?

728
28:38.490 --> 28:39.290
Are you sure?

729
28:39.510 --> 28:40.340
I'm sure.

730
28:42.890 --> 28:44.100
Let him say it again.

731
28:44.540 --> 28:45.470
Absolutely not.

732
28:47.980 --> 28:48.780
What's wrong?

733
28:59.140 --> 28:59.910
Go back.

734
29:00.120 --> 29:00.890
Okay.

735
29:02.540 --> 29:02.930
Alright.

736
29:02.930 --> 29:04.730
Then... Manager Qi, I'll be off.

737
29:08.140 --> 29:17.230
[Members Management Department]

738
29:23.780 --> 29:26.340
We've already given him his chance.

739
29:28.300 --> 29:29.300
Let's proceed

740
29:29.890 --> 29:31.060
as we agreed.

741
29:31.260 --> 29:32.060
Okay.

742
29:32.610 --> 29:33.670
I'll go arrange it.

743
29:39.600 --> 29:43.520
[Wugang New Pipeline Engineering Technology Co., Ltd.]

744
29:55.720 --> 30:02.490
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant]

745
30:00.340 --> 30:01.130
You guys,

746
30:01.370 --> 30:02.370
take down those signs

747
30:02.370 --> 30:03.260
and send them back.

748
30:02.510 --> 30:10.400
[Wugang New Pipeline Engineering Technology Co., Ltd.]

749
30:03.450 --> 30:04.980
-Okay. -Okay.

750
30:12.260 --> 30:13.520
What are you doing?

751
30:12.360 --> 30:15.490
[Put People First, Seek Truth and Innovate]

752
30:14.370 --> 30:15.820
Put that down! Put it down!

753
30:15.820 --> 30:16.410
Don't touch it! Put it down!

754
30:16.410 --> 30:17.320
What's going on?

755
30:17.320 --> 30:18.210
What do you mean?

756
30:18.210 --> 30:19.850
-Who do you work for? -Seal all the documents

757
30:19.850 --> 30:21.370
and pack them up to take with us.

758
30:21.370 --> 30:22.370
Wait. What...

759
30:22.370 --> 30:23.300
What do you mean?

760
30:25.000 --> 30:27.490
The head office is taking back control of the subsidiary.

761
30:27.490 --> 30:28.340
Naturally,

762
30:28.340 --> 30:29.560
all these assets have to be cleared out.

763
30:29.560 --> 30:31.500
Who authorized you to do this?

764
30:31.500 --> 30:32.210
I did.

765
30:34.690 --> 30:36.000
General Manager Geng Jian

766
30:36.000 --> 30:37.230
has seriously neglected his duties

767
30:37.230 --> 30:38.610
and embezzled project funds

768
30:38.610 --> 30:39.740
totaling

769
30:39.740 --> 30:41.060
500,000 yuan.

770
30:41.370 --> 30:41.820
What?

771
30:41.820 --> 30:42.580
That money alone

772
30:42.580 --> 30:43.940
is enough to cover all your salaries

773
30:43.940 --> 30:45.460
for several years.

774
30:44.010 --> 30:49.820
[Put People First, Seek Truth and Innovate]

775
30:45.610 --> 30:47.340
Yet he pocketed it for himself.

776
30:47.820 --> 30:49.170
The head office has decided

777
30:49.170 --> 30:50.300
to dismiss Geng Jian

778
30:50.300 --> 30:51.370
and take back the subsidiary.

779
30:51.370 --> 30:52.260
M-Manager Qi,

780
30:52.280 --> 30:54.650
that's a terrible thing to say.

781
30:54.650 --> 30:56.170
Whether or not these allegations are true,

782
30:56.170 --> 30:57.210
you can fire me,

783
30:57.210 --> 30:57.930
but you can't

784
30:57.930 --> 30:58.850
slander my character.

785
30:58.850 --> 30:59.580
Yes,

786
30:59.580 --> 31:00.650
all the money

787
31:00.650 --> 31:01.690
went through my hands.

788
31:01.690 --> 31:02.370
It went through my hands,

789
31:02.370 --> 31:03.740
but not a single penny

790
31:03.740 --> 31:04.820
went into my own pocket.

791
31:04.820 --> 31:05.980
Everyone knows

792
31:05.980 --> 31:06.980
that project of ours

793
31:06.980 --> 31:08.370
couldn't have gone ahead

794
31:08.370 --> 31:09.690
without us putting our own money into it.

795
31:09.690 --> 31:10.650
All that money

796
31:10.650 --> 31:11.370
went toward

797
31:11.370 --> 31:12.500
covering the project's shortfall.

798
31:12.500 --> 31:13.650
Godfather,

799
31:13.650 --> 31:15.130
save these words for the authorities

800
31:15.130 --> 31:15.850
and the police!

801
31:15.850 --> 31:17.510
Let's see if they believe you!

802
31:17.580 --> 31:18.260
No... Well...

803
31:18.260 --> 31:18.980
What I'm saying now

804
31:18.980 --> 31:20.370
isn't about explaining myself to the police.

805
31:20.370 --> 31:20.980
Whatever happens,

806
31:20.980 --> 31:22.260
I've done my best

807
31:22.280 --> 31:23.300
for this subsidiary

808
31:23.300 --> 31:24.980
and for Shan.

809
31:24.980 --> 31:26.370
I have a clear conscience.

810
31:26.370 --> 31:27.580
But as for you...

811
31:27.580 --> 31:28.340
You kept saying

812
31:28.340 --> 31:29.300
you want to help Shan,

813
31:29.300 --> 31:30.580
yet look what you're doing now.

814
31:30.580 --> 31:31.300
You're taking back the subsidiary.

815
31:31.300 --> 31:32.690
What is Shan supposed to...

816
31:32.690 --> 31:33.500
Shan...

817
31:33.690 --> 31:34.850
I won't say anything more.

818
31:34.850 --> 31:35.500
You...

819
31:36.210 --> 31:37.170
Fine. I...

820
31:37.820 --> 31:38.610
Fine.

821
31:39.340 --> 31:40.130
You...

822
31:41.390 --> 31:42.630
Okay.

823
31:42.780 --> 31:44.210
Well... Shan.

824
31:44.740 --> 31:45.610
I must

825
31:45.650 --> 31:46.980
apologize to you today.

826
31:47.300 --> 31:48.340
Because of what Godfather has done,

827
31:48.340 --> 31:49.820
he has to be dismissed.

828
31:49.820 --> 31:50.850
As for you...

829
31:51.980 --> 31:53.060
If you still want

830
31:53.080 --> 31:55.510
to try your luck in Guangdong,

831
31:55.610 --> 31:56.340
that's no problem.

832
31:56.340 --> 31:57.780
I can make a call

833
31:57.820 --> 31:58.610
to Guangdong Petrochemical.

834
31:58.610 --> 31:59.500
You can go anytime.

835
31:59.500 --> 32:00.300
Over there,

836
32:00.570 --> 32:01.450
you can still make

837
32:01.450 --> 32:02.580
a name for yourself.

838
32:03.210 --> 32:04.020
Mo,

839
32:05.130 --> 32:06.610
you've been running around

840
32:06.610 --> 32:08.100
and doing so much for me

841
32:08.260 --> 32:09.500
ever since I got out.

842
32:09.500 --> 32:10.650
I've seen it all.

843
32:11.130 --> 32:11.780
I also know

844
32:11.780 --> 32:13.210
you genuinely care about my sister,

845
32:13.210 --> 32:14.870
and that's why you've gone out of your way

846
32:14.870 --> 32:15.790
to help me.

847
32:16.210 --> 32:17.940
But I've already made up my mind

848
32:18.450 --> 32:19.780
about my future.

849
32:19.780 --> 32:21.310
I'm not going to Guangzhou.

850
32:22.020 --> 32:22.690
Alright.

851
32:22.690 --> 32:23.980
If you have any ideas,

852
32:24.000 --> 32:25.170
just let me know.

853
32:25.980 --> 32:27.540
I'm going to start a new company.

854
32:27.540 --> 32:29.270
I've already thought of a name:

855
32:29.300 --> 32:30.540
Fuwenshan

856
32:30.750 --> 32:32.760
Pipeline Engineering Technology Co., Ltd.

857
32:32.760 --> 32:34.270
The "Fu" comes from Chen Fu,

858
32:34.270 --> 32:35.540
the "Wen" from Zhang Wenying,

859
32:35.540 --> 32:37.360
and the "Shan" from my name, Chen Shan.

860
32:37.360 --> 32:39.170
I don't have any other special skills.

861
32:39.170 --> 32:40.560
This is what I studied,

862
32:40.590 --> 32:41.610
so I'll stay

863
32:41.610 --> 32:43.370
in the petrochemical industry.

864
32:43.370 --> 32:44.060
There's one more thing.

865
32:44.060 --> 32:45.470
I don't want to hide it from you, Mo.

866
32:45.470 --> 32:47.210
Once the new company is established,

867
32:47.210 --> 32:48.370
we'll bid on

868
32:48.370 --> 32:49.820
Project 713 Phase 2.

869
32:49.980 --> 32:50.820
That means

870
32:50.980 --> 32:51.930
we may become

871
32:51.930 --> 32:52.820
competitors.

872
32:53.300 --> 32:54.370
If the day comes

873
32:54.370 --> 32:56.520
when we have to go head-to-head,

874
32:57.650 --> 32:59.060
I won't hold back.

875
32:59.480 --> 33:00.740
I hope you understand.

876
33:04.500 --> 33:05.300
Well...

877
33:05.910 --> 33:08.060
It seems you've been thinking about this

878
33:08.060 --> 33:09.610
for quite some time.

879
33:09.760 --> 33:11.170
You've got the guts to dream big and make things happen.

880
33:11.170 --> 33:12.100
You have my support.

881
33:12.100 --> 33:12.820
Alright?

882
33:12.930 --> 33:14.820
Tell me if you lack

883
33:14.820 --> 33:15.680
any resources.

884
33:16.350 --> 33:17.740
Give him a business card.

885
33:17.740 --> 33:18.540
He...

886
33:18.820 --> 33:19.980
He is familiar with the suppliers

887
33:19.980 --> 33:21.580
and construction teams

888
33:21.610 --> 33:22.370
at the head office.

889
33:22.370 --> 33:23.300
If you have any problems,

890
33:23.300 --> 33:24.260
just call him.

891
33:24.290 --> 33:24.930
Yes.

892
33:25.860 --> 33:26.750
Thank you, Mo.

893
33:26.980 --> 33:29.310
Then I'll keep things strictly business.

894
33:31.370 --> 33:32.700
Don't just stand there.

895
33:32.850 --> 33:33.850
Take them with us.

896
34:01.930 --> 34:02.740
Godfather.

897
34:04.820 --> 34:06.370
What was Qi Mo talking about

898
34:06.930 --> 34:07.820
just now?

899
34:12.380 --> 34:13.210
Shan.

900
34:14.980 --> 34:17.980
If they want to find fault with you, they'll find a way.

901
34:19.730 --> 34:21.250
It's not that simple.

902
34:22.730 --> 34:23.900
Was he targeting me?

903
34:24.130 --> 34:25.330
He was targeting you.

904
34:25.900 --> 34:27.250
It was just an excuse.

905
34:27.250 --> 34:27.900
He just doesn't want you

906
34:27.900 --> 34:28.940
to stay in this city

907
34:28.940 --> 34:30.460
or join the subsidiary.

908
34:36.100 --> 34:36.730
Were...

909
34:36.730 --> 34:38.590
Were you just talking out of anger

910
34:38.610 --> 34:39.710
when you said you were going to start

911
34:39.710 --> 34:40.830
your own company?

912
34:42.770 --> 34:43.580
Godfather,

913
34:44.020 --> 34:45.389
I haven't told you...

914
34:45.860 --> 34:46.980
about this before.

915
34:47.690 --> 34:49.219
I've been thinking about it

916
34:49.500 --> 34:50.860
for a long time.

917
34:51.540 --> 34:52.980
I was already working on the idea

918
34:52.980 --> 34:53.940
when I was in prison.

919
34:53.940 --> 34:55.800
I've already thought it through.

920
34:56.060 --> 34:58.190
I want to use all my compensation money

921
34:58.460 --> 34:59.690
and mortgage the house

922
34:59.690 --> 35:00.690
to raise

923
35:00.810 --> 35:01.980
the capital to start

924
35:01.980 --> 35:02.910
the new company.

925
35:03.060 --> 35:03.940
I've even picked out a location

926
35:03.940 --> 35:04.900
for the office.

927
35:06.380 --> 35:08.100
It'll be right next door to this company.

928
35:08.100 --> 35:09.500
And I already have an idea

929
35:09.580 --> 35:11.240
of whom to bring onto the team.

930
35:12.770 --> 35:13.580
Godfather,

931
35:14.900 --> 35:16.830
don't worry about all the details.

932
35:17.130 --> 35:19.330
Just get ready to make a fortune with me.

933
35:22.810 --> 35:23.980
Shan,

934
35:24.860 --> 35:26.210
I've realized

935
35:26.210 --> 35:27.610
I really can't keep seeing you

936
35:27.610 --> 35:29.380
as the little boy

937
35:29.380 --> 35:29.980
you used to be.

938
35:29.980 --> 35:31.330
You've grown into

939
35:31.540 --> 35:32.980
a man now.

940
35:34.380 --> 35:36.240
You can stand on your own two feet.

941
35:36.250 --> 35:37.500
Listening to the way

942
35:37.500 --> 35:38.020
you spoke to Qi Mo

943
35:38.020 --> 35:39.290
just now,

944
35:39.770 --> 35:40.730
the composure you showed,

945
35:40.730 --> 35:41.460
the way...

946
35:41.650 --> 35:43.050
you handled yourself...

947
35:43.060 --> 35:44.540
You really impressed me.

948
35:46.810 --> 35:47.290
Great.

949
35:47.290 --> 35:48.210
I...

950
35:48.290 --> 35:50.210
I'm an old man with only half a life left in me.

951
35:50.210 --> 35:51.650
I'll stand by you all the way.

952
35:51.650 --> 35:53.060
I've got the experience

953
35:53.460 --> 35:54.610
and the technical know-how.

954
35:54.610 --> 35:56.070
Then let's do it together.

955
35:56.380 --> 35:57.170
Let's do it!

956
35:57.860 --> 35:58.540
Let's do it!

957
36:02.690 --> 36:03.380
He wants to bid for

958
36:03.380 --> 36:04.810
Project 713 Phase 2?

959
36:05.460 --> 36:06.290
What is he thinking?

960
36:06.290 --> 36:07.690
He wants to compete with you?

961
36:07.690 --> 36:08.820
That's a good thing.

962
36:11.580 --> 36:12.940
Here, here.

963
36:13.810 --> 36:15.920
I think it's a good thing.

964
36:16.540 --> 36:17.330
Look,

965
36:17.330 --> 36:19.380
he got out of prison,

966
36:19.500 --> 36:20.500
didn't go astray,

967
36:20.500 --> 36:21.170
and is on the right path.

968
36:21.170 --> 36:22.380
Isn't that great?

969
36:23.210 --> 36:24.330
Be... Be gentle.

970
36:25.380 --> 36:26.290
Secondly, since he wants to start a company,

971
36:26.290 --> 36:28.130
we should encourage him.

972
36:28.900 --> 36:30.360
He wants to prove himself.

973
36:30.500 --> 36:31.610
There's no problem with that.

974
36:31.610 --> 36:32.380
He just can't shake

975
36:32.380 --> 36:34.510
that self-righteous attitude of his.

976
36:34.570 --> 36:35.850
Starting a company?

977
36:36.940 --> 36:37.770
But

978
36:38.580 --> 36:39.940
I'm worried about the fact

979
36:39.940 --> 36:41.290
that he wants to bid on

980
36:41.730 --> 36:42.980
Project 713 Phase 2.

981
36:43.250 --> 36:45.380
After all, our company is much bigger

982
36:45.540 --> 36:47.000
and has plenty of capital.

983
36:47.210 --> 36:49.380
If he takes out such a huge loan

984
36:49.460 --> 36:50.210
and things go wrong,

985
36:50.210 --> 36:50.980
he could lose everything.

986
36:50.980 --> 36:52.380
What then?

987
36:52.730 --> 36:54.130
How about you talk to him?

988
36:55.170 --> 36:56.230
I won't talk to him.

989
36:56.420 --> 36:58.750
He won't listen until he hits a brick wall.

990
37:00.060 --> 37:01.020
I still think

991
37:01.540 --> 37:03.470
you should try to talk him out of it.

992
37:03.730 --> 37:05.810
He's family, after all.

993
37:05.980 --> 37:07.610
We can't just stand by and watch him

994
37:07.610 --> 37:08.540
get himself into serious trouble,

995
37:08.540 --> 37:09.170
can we?

996
37:11.130 --> 37:13.590
I really don't want to get involved anymore.

997
37:13.980 --> 37:14.980
Go make dinner.

998
37:16.380 --> 37:18.110
I'm going to make dinner, then.

999
37:18.690 --> 37:20.220
But think about what I said.

1000
37:28.370 --> 37:29.150
[Shimo Village]

1001
37:31.730 --> 37:33.330
It should be this way, right?

1002
37:33.380 --> 37:34.540
Is it reliable?

1003
37:34.880 --> 37:36.110
It should be fine.

1004
37:36.860 --> 37:37.770
Where are they?

1005
37:39.380 --> 37:40.170
Shan.

1006
37:40.220 --> 37:40.910
Over here.

1007
37:40.980 --> 37:41.770
You're here.

1008
37:41.860 --> 37:43.100
We've been waiting for you.

1009
37:43.100 --> 37:43.610
Come on.

1010
37:43.610 --> 37:45.060
Come to the table.

1011
37:48.010 --> 37:49.730
Come sit here.

1012
37:51.360 --> 37:53.700
You three? Starting a company?

1013
37:53.720 --> 37:54.940
Why can't the three of us start a company?

1014
37:54.940 --> 37:55.210
That's right.

1015
37:55.210 --> 37:57.290
The three of us are starting a company,

1016
37:57.290 --> 37:58.210
and we'd like to invite you

1017
37:58.210 --> 37:59.020
to join us.

1018
38:00.810 --> 38:01.580
Chen Shan,

1019
38:02.610 --> 38:03.860
we came here today

1020
38:04.900 --> 38:06.630
out of respect for your father.

1021
38:07.020 --> 38:07.770
It doesn't mean

1022
38:07.770 --> 38:09.380
we have to work with you.

1023
38:09.380 --> 38:11.540
Well, I'm grateful

1024
38:11.730 --> 38:13.380
you came out of respect for my father.

1025
38:13.380 --> 38:14.500
But I believe

1026
38:14.960 --> 38:17.100
we'll definitely end up working together.

1027
38:17.100 --> 38:18.020
Because we have

1028
38:18.020 --> 38:19.290
a common target—

1029
